# Purpose
Explains how to write project summaries with current state, purpose, status,
history, and changed work separated clearly.

# Key Sections
- When to use this guide.
- Start with the current state.
- Include the purpose.
- Separate status from history.
- Name what changed.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Do not collapse unresolved risks into completed status.

